# lifecycle

Drive a unit of work through the codified state-gated development lifecycle (Specify→Clarify→Spec-Review→Plan→Task Creation→Analyze→Spec-Review tech→Implement→Verify). Use to start, advance, inspect, or regress a tracked feature/issue; enforces phase order (hard-halt for agents, advisory for humans) and the smoke-test Verify gate. Entry is a ticket URL or issue key (GitHub/GitLab/Linear/Jira).

